flowchart TB
  C[Customer browser - product inquiry]
  P[WordPress server - persist original snapshot]
  Q[WordPress server - enqueue outbox separately]
  E[Server worker - claim lease and sign delivery]
  V[Edge Function - validate HMAC and envelope]
  D[Postgres transaction - replay or create CRM records]
  T[Staff browser - work item and authoritative next task]
  R[Server - revision-checked quote draft]
  I[Server - explicit issuance and immutable version]
  X[Retry with backoff or mark failed]
  C --> P --> Q --> E --> V --> D --> T --> R --> I
  E -->|Delivery failure| X
  X -->|Retryable| E
  N[Inspected implementation; no new live end-to-end submission. Customer and staff browsers cross separate server trust boundaries.]
